  <p>
    Here is the part most "physiotherapy scope" pages soften. The brochure version of this career and the version a
    fresh BPT graduate actually lives through in year one are describing two different jobs, and the gap between
    them is the real source of the field's underreported injury and attrition problem.
  </p>

